  "id": "USN-9114-1",
  "summary": "minetest vulnerabilities",
  "details": "It was discovered that Minetest did not deserialize data in a restricted\nenvironment. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to modify\narbitrary item metadata or execute arbitrary code. (CVE-2022-24300)\n\nIt was discovered that Minetest did not properly validate certain inventory\nactions. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to add or remove\nitems from the inventories of other players. (CVE-2022-24301)",
